fixture dash_up_ramp_onto_door_at_crest
doc Physics review 4: a ground dash up the 45-degree ramp of test/ramp45_door_at_crest (a door 1 u proud of the plateau from the crest edge, x 384). The step up counts from the floor at the box's leading edge, so the dash steps onto the door and runs on at 20 u a tick; counted from the feet, it stopped at the lip.
room test/ramp45_door_at_crest
spawn 300 342
frames 14
input
  0..1 R
  2 R dash
  3..13 R
end
expect
  at 13 xu>=420
end
